EEXXIITT SSTTAATTUUSS
     The iinnssttaallll utility exits 0 on success, and >0 if an error occurs.

CCOOMMPPAATTIIBBIILLIITTYY
     Historically iinnssttaallll moved files by default.  The default was changed to
     copy in FreeBSD 4.4.

